8. Our relentless focus on cash continues and is reflected in free cash flows of $884 mn, which 
is 109% of net profit. This is the fifth consecutive quarter of free cash flow being over 100% of net 
profit. We expect FY26 free cash flows to be above 100% of net profit.  
